ED Decision 2014/012/R
REPORTING
(a) The aerodrome operator should report on matters of operational significance or affecting aircraft and aerodrome operations in order to take appropriate action, particularly in respect of the following:
(1) construction or maintenance work;
(2) rough or broken surfaces on a runway, a taxiway, or an apron;
(3) snow, slush ice or frost on a runway, a taxiway, or an apron;
